# Source-distribution contents.
#
# The wheel already contains exactly the importable package (the `omr*`
# packages selected in pyproject.toml); this file only shapes the sdist.
#
# setuptools' default sdist template pulls in top-level `tests/test*.py`
# but NOT their conftest.py, private helpers, or the large ported test
# corpus under tests/testdata/ -- i.e. a partial, un-runnable test tree.
# The test suite and its ~1.8k-file corpus are development-only, so drop
# the whole tree from the sdist rather than ship it incomplete.
prune tests

# LICENSE and README.md are included automatically (license-files +
# the readme entry in pyproject.toml); no further includes are needed.
